{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受词条较多，纵向交替阅读不如X左右分栏来得轻松，尤其S05这类只有18秒的段落，扫读压力比较明显。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏和精简感受词更容易让观众快速扫屏，但Y通过【】突出每段心理落点，又用到时出现的感受把音乐变化与人物心境逐步对应起来，实际听读时能获得更细的层次。更重要的是，Y保留了人物从害怕自己的需要成为负担，到意识到自己也需要对方，再到即使不能保证永远也愿意继续付出的心理转变，因果和情感递进比X完整，尤其S11、S13的表达更有深度。综合来看，Y虽然牺牲了一些扫读效率，却在理解人物、把握前后关系和感受音乐细节方面优势更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a22fcc20-da92-4c6d-beaa-54b05f1ae07e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154501935307Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:46:00.854247+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "abeb0759bba6885299cc5f237939a2aeeacefe0f8f3f02cf922171520bc9cedc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb